  "macroRenderedOutput": {},
  "body": {
    "storage": {
      "value": "<p>EMR-API has a domain object called Diagnosis that has several fields. <br />- CodedAnswer <br />- NonCodedAnswer - if the diagnosis is not yet coded<br />- Order (primary vs secondary) <br />- Certainty (presumed vs confirmed). <br />In the database this is stored as an observation group called Diagnosis with each member as an observation group member.</p><p>For Bahmni, we needed to track the lifecycle of a diagnosis. To achieve this, we added three new fields. <br />- Status (Ruled out, Cured)<br />- Initial (uuid of the initial observation) <br />- isRevised(true and false).</p><p>Status is not mandatory, but provides interesting modifiers to the diagnosis like &quot;ruled out&quot;, &quot;cured&quot; etc. <br />IsRevised will be set to true when a diagnosis is revised.</p>",
      "representation": "storage",
      "embeddedContent": [],
      "_expandable": {
        "content": "/rest/api/content/2850824"
      }
    },
    "view": {
